{%- comment -%}
  ShortcutX Deep Sleep — Landing Page Section
  Install instructions:
  1. Upload all files in assets/ to Shopify Admin → Themes → Assets
  2. Add sections/deep-sleep.liquid to your theme's sections/ folder
  3. Add templates/page.deep-sleep.json to your theme's templates/ folder
  4. In Shopify Admin → Online Store → Pages, create a page and set template to "deep-sleep"
  5. Update VARIANT_ID in assets/deep-sleep.js with the real Shopify product variant ID
{%- endcomment -%}

